setFeedRoute.t.sol
├── when caller does not have the relevant role
│  └── it should revert with AccessManagedUnauthorized
└── when caller has the relevant role
   ├── given first price feed is null
   │  └── it should revert with InvalidFeedRoute
   └── given first price feed is non null
      ├── given the token decimals are unavailable, below minimum or above maximum
      │  └── it should revert with InvalidDecimals
      └── given the token decimals are within allowed range
         ├── it should associate the provided feed route to provided token in oracle registry storage
         ├── it should associate the provided feeds to respective staleness thresholds in oracle registry storage
         └── it should emit a FeedRouteRegistered event
